  "origin": "The gap tiers reach planning from four sites and only the construction ones were walked. The review lane is the one where the stop has to fight for itself: by the time a finding indicts the specification the user has usually handed the walk over to auto, and the exchange is the one call auto never makes. This pins that — the verbatim `Auto is on — stopping anyway:` announcement over a live `finding_gate_mode: auto`, the decision landing in the discussion, the corrigendum re-aligning the specification, and the finding re-disposed `settled` against the corrected record and applied with no second stop. It also pins that a landing touches no manifest state: the wait gate at the conclusion comes back empty.",
